  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Sign onto vrchat using a secondary meta account rather than primary (admin). 2. Go to any world with a video player. 3. Copy/paste any URL (YouTube for example). I have tested this on different quests along with swapping back and forth to confirm. I had this issue ever since the URLs was added locally available on quest. It took me forever to find a solution til one day I forgot to switch to my account (the secondary meta account) and used the admin one. I don't know how this would cause any issues but please fix this.",
